// Copy this file to LocalSigning.xcconfig (same folder) and fill in your own
// values. LocalSigning.xcconfig is gitignored, so your Apple Developer team ID
// never gets committed. See docs/platform-builds/ios.md.

// Your 10-character Apple Developer Team ID: developer.apple.com -> Account ->
// Membership details, or Xcode -> Settings -> Accounts -> your team.
TEAM_ID=

// A reverse-DNS prefix you control. Bundle IDs are globally unique per Apple
// team, so com.jabramson (the default) is already taken -- use your own,
// e.g. com.yourname. The app's bundle ID becomes
// $(BUNDLE_ID_PREFIX).iperf3-network-tester-kmp
BUNDLE_ID_PREFIX=com.example
